## Output requirements

Produce ONE compelling self-description (≤60 words) that re-frames the item for
THIS user under the active directive (and trend signal if any). Then add the
structured grounding fields:

1. ``description``           — the ≤60-word headline NL (always required).
2. ``audience_fit``          — float in [0, 1] for this user.
3. ``anchored_attributes``   — the item attributes you actually referenced.
{% if audience %}
4. ``audience_fit_claim_nl`` — one sentence claiming WHO you serve well,
   grounded in the buyer aggregate above. Cite a concrete number.
5. ``outlier_note_nl``       — optional. If a clear minority buyer cohort
   appears, name it; otherwise omit.
{% endif %}
{% if has_trend %}
6. ``trend_position``        — object describing how you sit vs. the trend:
   - ``lifecycle``: one of ``rising | stable | declining | niche``
   - ``alignment``: one of ``aligned | orthogonal | counter``
   - ``value_proposition_nl`` REQUIRED when lifecycle="declining" or
     alignment="counter" — otherwise omit.
{% endif %}

Return ONE JSON object matching the schema. Omit fields that are not applicable.
